	| Agent Name    | Koroneiki User                           |
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Last Name     | Contact2                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	Then I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Email Address" from the old value "" to the new value "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" executed by "Koroneiki Admin"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Update" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Email Address" from the old value "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to the new value "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" executed by "Koroneiki User"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Email Address" from the old value "" to the new value "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" executed by "Koroneiki Admin"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Update" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Email Address" from the old value "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to the new value "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" executed by "Koroneiki User"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Email Address" from the old value "" to the new value "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" executed by "Koroneiki Admin" via the audit entry key
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Update" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Email Address" from the old value "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to the new value "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" executed by "Koroneiki User" via the audit entry key

Scenario: View contact external link audit entries
	Koroneiki contact changes related to external links via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I create an external link for the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" with the following values
	| Domain      | koroneikicontact |
	| Entity Id   | 1234             |
	| Entity Name | KoroneikiContact |
	And I delete an external link with the entity id "1234" on the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	Then I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Domain" from the old value "" to the new value "koroneikicontact" executed by "Koroneiki Admin"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Entity Id" from the old value "" to the new value "1234" executed by "Koroneiki Admin"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Entity Name" from the old value "" to the new value "KoroneikiContact" executed by "Koroneiki Admin"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Delete" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Domain" from the old value "koroneikicontact" to the new value "" executed by "Koroneiki Admin"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Delete" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Entity Id" from the old value "1234" to the new value "" executed by "Koroneiki Admin"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Delete" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Entity Name" from the old value "KoroneikiContact" to the new value "" executed by "Koroneiki Admin"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Domain" from the old value "" to the new value "koroneikicontact" executed by "Koroneiki Admin" via the audit entry key
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Entity Id" from the old value "" to the new value "1234" executed by "Koroneiki Admin" via the audit entry key
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Entity Name" from the old value "" to the new value "KoroneikiContact" executed by "Koroneiki Admin" via the audit entry key
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Delete" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Domain" from the old value "koroneikicontact" to the new value "" executed by "Koroneiki Admin" via the audit entry key
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Delete" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Entity Id" from the old value "1234" to the new value "" executed by "Koroneiki Admin" via the audit entry key
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Delete" to the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" field "Entity Name" from the old value "KoroneikiContact" to the new value "" executed by "Koroneiki Admin" via the audit entry key

